<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Social-Network on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/social-network/</link><description>Recent content in Social-Network on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 Jul 2011 10:50:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/social-network/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Google Plus</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/google-plus/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Jul 2011 10:50:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/google-plus/</guid><description>&lt;div dir="ltr" style="text-align: left;" trbidi="on"&gt;Having my first look at Google+, so far looks nice.&lt;br /&gt;&#10;Need to figure out if you can get a RSS feed of the items you've +'ed?&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/5890569192/" title="Having a play with Google+ by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm6.static.flickr.com/5231/5890569192_465892e55e_z.jpg" width="640" height="424" alt="Having a play with Google+"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;br /&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="http://meekgonkey.blogspot.com/"&gt;Doodle's Geek Monkey&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="http://twitter.com/alastair_hm"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Social Network Status Generator</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bloglines-social-network-status/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2008 12:16:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/bloglines-social-network-status/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 18 of this post&amp;rsquo;s 30 links are now broken — mostly dead 2008–2013 feed-syndication infrastructure (FeedBurner, Gawker, AOL&amp;rsquo;s old blog network, Pheedo, Yahoo Pipes). Left as originally published.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.bloglines.com/"&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;table width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;a name="base9477167"&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;table id="table9477167" bg="" style="color: rgb(189, 224, 237);" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt; &lt;td rowspan="2"&gt; &lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;span class="blogtitle"&gt;&lt;a href="http://pipes.yahoo.com/pipes/pipe.info?_id=8IsQFi282xG5FaTJJjBjOg"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Life GH Com&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pipes Output &lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt; &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;a name="base9477167"&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;div id="items9477167" style="display: block;"&gt; &lt;table width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr bgcolor="#ffffff"&gt; &lt;td&gt; &lt;table width="100%"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a title="Site: Life GH Com" href="http://www.ghacks.net/2008/11/17/social-network-status-generator/"&gt;Social Network Status Generator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have we come this far already? Desperate times require desperate measures it seems. To impress, one has to be witty. This is especially hard on social networks with millions of other users who want to impress as well.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>